# 17. VERIFY THE DESIRED FEATURE AGAINST REAL CODE

The target feature is strictly:

```text
Normal Step-1 execution
        ↓
Result generated
        ↓
Diagnosis receives actual report + actual search/retrieval metadata
        ↓
NOT_RECOMMENDED
        ↓
No enhancement UI shown
Normal workflow continues
```

OR:

```text
RECOMMENDED
        ↓
Potential Improvement card
        ↓
User chooses:
Dismiss
Edit
Apply & Rescan
```

For Apply & Rescan:

```text
User-approved text
        ↓
feedback_consolidation
        ↓
runtime refinement instruction
        ↓
Trigger 1:
existing refine_event()

OR

Trigger 2:
active enrichment/rescan path
        ↓
updated eight-section result
```

No master prompt rewrite.

No automatic rescan.

No automatic feedback submission.

No new search direction unless explicitly approved by user.

Verify whether the uploaded implementation meets each requirement.

